# Decision: Cap

English | [中文](/.agents/notes/proposed/<class>/<yyyy-mm-dd-slug>/proposal.zh.md)

Status: proposed

Proposal authors: <stable-role-or-handle>

## Problem

**Symptom**: Limit is vague.
**Cost**: Inconsistent callers.

## Proposal

Use 30 seconds.

## Scope

All requests.

## Alternatives considered

An unbounded timeout loses predictability.

## Acceptance criteria

Reject larger values.

## Risks

Existing requests may exceed the cap.
<!-- example:begin id=timeout kind=walkthrough mode=optional -->
A request with 31 seconds fails the 30-second cap.
